---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — The Little AI Company"
  description="The Little AI Company helps non-technical people build practical AI skills, better judgment, and reliable ways of working with AI agents."
>
  <section class="about">
    <span class="eyebrow">// about</span>
    <h1>We help non-technical people get genuinely good at using AI.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The Little AI Company turns useful techniques from inside the AI world into
      plain-English skills, hands-on workshops, and tools that ordinary people can
      actually use. The goal is capability: better results, better judgment, and less
      dependence on guesswork.
    </p>

    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <ul class="beliefs">
      <li>
        <b>Capability before hype.</b> People need repeatable ways to do real work with
        AI, not another tour of impressive features.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Judgment is part of the skill.</b> Good AI use means checking claims, tracing
        sources, understanding limits, and knowing when a human must decide.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>People stay in control.</b> Privacy, ownership, and clear stop points matter
        more than automation for its own sake.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Tools should be inspectable.</b> Our software preserves context, state, and
        evidence so people can understand what an agent did and why.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Education first. Software in service of the work.</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Guides, workshops, and free learning resources are core company work. Vivary,
      Agent Relay, and Bellamente support that mission: they solve recurring problems,
      preserve what we learn, and give people better infrastructure for reliable AI work.
    </p>

    <p class="trustline">
      Practical skills. Better judgment. Tools you can inspect.
    </p>

    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/start-here">Start learning →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/services">Work with us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 0 40px; }
  .about h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); font-weight: 900; margin: 16px 0 0; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 19px; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
  .about h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; margin: 40px 0 14px; }
  .body { font-size: 17px; }
  .beliefs { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .beliefs li {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px 18px; font-size: 16px;
  }
  .trustline { margin-top: 36px; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
